00:19:47,900 --> 00:19:50,297
Seems like the person who
was supposed to help out

259
00:19:50,380 --> 00:19:53,262
hurt their back at work
while eating a bento box.

260
00:19:53,560 --> 00:19:54,390
Bento socks?

261
00:19:54,600 --> 00:19:55,937
But they're made of cotton.

262
00:19:56,020 --> 00:19:57,900
Man, what an idiot. Ha ha.

263
00:20:00,400 --> 00:20:01,340
Come on, now.

264
00:20:01,800 --> 00:20:04,697
Can't shoot if we don't
got room to scoot, Yaniko.

265
00:20:04,780 --> 00:20:07,240
Yakuko, open your window. G-got it.

266
00:20:11,940 --> 00:20:16,157
Wouldn't it be funny as all get out
if we blasted a toot through the mic?

267
00:20:16,240 --> 00:20:17,760
Yaniko, point it my way!

268
00:20:19,040 --> 00:20:20,520
Get that tail higher!

269
00:20:21,400 --> 00:20:22,517
That's a good girl!

270
00:20:22,600 --> 00:20:24,357
You ready to blast out another one?

271
00:20:24,440 --> 00:20:27,277
We're gonna let it ring loud
enough to wake the dead!

272
00:20:27,360 --> 00:20:28,831
That'll get him laughing!

273
00:20:28,980 --> 00:20:31,497
Okay, but that well's just
about run dry, Kansai.

274
00:20:31,580 --> 00:20:33,537
I'll buy you smoke if you pass a good one.

275
00:20:33,620 --> 00:20:34,450
You're on!

276
00:20:42,620 --> 00:20:44,220
Sweet Jesus, you did it!

277
00:20:44,580 --> 00:20:45,410
And it was a loud one, too!

278
00:20:45,493 --> 00:20:46,737
Can't they hear us talking, too, though?

279
00:20:46,820 --> 00:20:48,377
Keep those loud ones coming!

280
00:20:48,460 --> 00:20:50,931
And you're on your way to free cigarettes!

281
00:20:56,500 --> 00:20:58,382
Okay, okay, baby, that's enough!

282
00:20:58,540 --> 00:21:00,000
See a lot of my glasses!

283
00:21:02,160 --> 00:21:03,220
What was that one?

284
00:21:03,400 --> 00:21:05,047
Did you get shot in the van?

285
00:21:22,680 --> 00:21:24,820
What on earth? I got stuck.

286
00:21:25,040 --> 00:21:27,297
Totally wouldn't be mad if
you gave me a push, Kansai.

287
00:21:27,380 --> 00:21:30,027
How in the blue blazes
does this even happen?

288
00:21:30,920 --> 00:21:32,700
My word is that soft.

289
00:21:33,620 --> 00:21:35,440
I can't get any good grip.

290
00:21:36,120 --> 00:21:37,780
You gotta flex them blutes.

291
00:21:38,100 --> 00:21:41,453
I don't feel like I'm making
any progress at all, though.

292
00:21:42,260 --> 00:21:47,084
I get it, but don't this sort of thing
look like we're batting for the other team?

293
00:21:47,360 --> 00:21:48,190
It's okay.

294
00:21:48,320 --> 00:21:50,577
Just try and bring me some
six from time to time.

295
00:21:50,660 --> 00:21:52,013
You can't just give up.

296
00:21:52,140 --> 00:21:56,140
I'm gonna give you a smack if all
you're doing is flexing your butt.

297
00:21:57,380 --> 00:21:58,210
Ah!

298
00:21:58,780 --> 00:21:59,720
Huh? Uh?

299
00:21:59,900 --> 00:22:01,380
What are they scaring at?

300
00:22:02,480 --> 00:22:03,310
Don't!

301
00:22:03,660 --> 00:22:04,490
Dude!

302
00:22:04,573 --> 00:22:06,795
What the same hell is wrong with them?

303
00:23:57,380 --> 00:23:58,210
Thank you.

304
00:24:31,220 --> 00:24:32,580
Thank you.
